notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 from scratch (one scripted change per file) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage (the footage link names a contributor-made test image that is not included; its stored path was replaced by a neutral one of the same length), presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is byte-identical to the generated file; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small.
